/* <orly/lang_tests/general/diag_mutate_plain_value.orly>

   Diagnostics pin (issue #557): a mutation whose target is a plain value,
   not a stored one, used to crash orlyc with a segfault and no message.
   It must report a clean error. It passes when compilation fails with the
   message its .state baseline pins (lang_test: expect-compile-error).

